    {title:"Browser storage and withdrawing consent",paragraphs:[
-    "If email signup is available, we store the address you provide, flight preferences, consent version and signup, confirmation and deactivation dates. The subscription is not active until the address is confirmed. The email link lets you change settings and unsubscribe. We do not share the address with offer partners. Flight summaries are not yet being sent; the form describes the service's current status.",
